# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Agentic AI coding assistants
#
# Assistant state, caches, transcripts and local rule overrides are personal to
# a contributor's machine and must not end up in the repository. Shared,
# reviewed guidance files (for example a committed AGENTS.md) are re-included
# explicitly below.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

